---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How roammate Works — Travel Companion Matching App"
  description="See how roammate matches solo travelers by style, budget, and destination — with verified profiles, safety controls, and zero ads or subscriptions."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "How roammate Works",
      "url": "https://roammate.com/how-it-works/",
      "description": "How roammate matches solo travelers with compatible companions by travel style, budget, and destination.",
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="hiw-hero">
    <div class="hiw-hero-inner">
      <div class="section-label section-label--center">How It Works</div>
      <h1 class="hiw-title">From solo to <em>social</em> in three steps</h1>
      <p class="hiw-subtitle">roammate finds people who travel the way you do — not just people who happen to be nearby.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="hiw-steps">
    <div class="hiw-steps-inner">
      <div class="hiw-step reveal">
        <div class="hiw-step-num">01</div>
        <div class="hiw-step-body">
          <h2>Build your travel profile</h2>
          <p>Set your travel style (adventure, cultural, slow travel, food-focused), budget bracket, and where you're heading. This is the data roammate uses to match you — so the more honest you are, the better your matches.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hiw-step reveal">
        <div class="hiw-step-num">02</div>
        <div class="hiw-step-body">
          <h2>Browse compatible travelers</h2>
          <p>See other travelers who overlap with your destination, match your budget range, and share your travel style. Browse their profiles, read their trip plans, and decide who you want to connect with — before committing to anything.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hiw-step reveal">
        <div class="hiw-step-num">03</div>
        <div class="hiw-step-body">
          <h2>Connect and go</h2>
          <p>Send a message, meet up, and take it from there. Share a guesthouse, split a tour, hike together, or just grab dinner. roammate handles the introduction — the rest is up to you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Differentiators -->
  <section class="hiw-features">
    <div class="hiw-features-inner">
      <div class="hiw-features-header reveal">
        <div class="section-label section-label--center">What sets us apart</div>
        <h2 class="hiw-features-title">Built for travelers, <em>not everyone</em></h2>
        <p class="hiw-features-subtitle">Every decision roammate makes is optimised for solo travelers and small groups — not general social networking.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw-grid">

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Matched by style, budget &amp; destination</h3>
          <p>Most apps show you whoever is nearby. roammate filters by travel pace, spending range, and itinerary overlap first — so every suggestion is genuinely compatible, not just geographically convenient.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Verified profiles</h3>
          <p>Every roammate user goes through identity verification before connecting with others. You see a verified badge on profiles that have completed the process — so you know who you're actually talking to before agreeing to meet.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Safety controls built in</h3>
          <p>Report and block any user in two taps. Trip plans are only shared with matched users, never publicly. For solo female travelers in particular, roammate's verification layer and privacy defaults are designed to put safety first, not as an afterthought.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Real-time &amp; pre-trip</h3>
          <p>Already in a city and want to find someone for today? Or planning ahead for next month? roammate works both ways — connect with travelers already at your destination right now, or arrange to meet up before you arrive.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Solo-first, not bolted on</h3>
          <p>roammate is purpose-built for solo travelers — not a feature tacked onto a dating app or a general social network. Every part of the product, from the matching algorithm to the profile structure, is designed around how solo travelers actually think and move.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hiw-card reveal">
          <div class="hiw-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Free. No ads. No subscriptions.</h3>
          <p>roammate is free to download and free to use — no premium tier that gatekeeps matches, no ads interrupting your browsing, no subscription to cancel. The app makes money when travelers have great experiences and tell their friends.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="hiw-cta">
    <div class="hiw-cta-inner">
      <h2 class="hiw-cta-heading">Ready to find your <em>travel companion?</em></h2>
      <p class="hiw-cta-body">Free on iOS. Android coming soon.</p>
      <div class="hiw-cta-actions">
        <a
          href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6758834253?pt=118224460&ct=how-it-works-cta&mt=8"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="hiw-cta-btn"
          data-ph-event="hiw_appstore_click"
        >
          <img src={`${base}images/app-store-badge.png`} alt="Download on the App Store" width="135" height="45" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        <a href="/companions/" class="hiw-cta-link" data-ph-event="hiw_companions_click">Browse companions by city →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hiw-hero {
    padding: 160px 40px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hiw-hero-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-label--center {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-label--center::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .hiw-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 80px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hiw-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .hiw-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  /* Steps */
  .hiw-steps {
    padding: 0 40px 100px;
  }

  .hiw-steps-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .hiw-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.1);
  }

  .hiw-step:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .hiw-step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    opacity: 0.15;
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .hiw-step-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hiw-step-body p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  /* Features */
  .hiw-features {
    padding: 80px 40px 120px;
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
  }

  .hiw-features-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hiw-features-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 72px;
  }

  .hiw-features-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .hiw-features-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .hiw-features-subtitle {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  .hiw-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .hiw-card {
    padding: 36px 28px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .hiw-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .hiw-card-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .hiw-card-icon svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    stroke: var(--color-terracotta-light);
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .hiw-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .hiw-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .hiw-cta {
    padding: 100px 40px 120px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hiw-cta-inner {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hiw-cta-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hiw-cta-heading em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .hiw-cta-body {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .hiw-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .hiw-cta-btn {
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .hiw-cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hiw-cta-link {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .hiw-cta-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hiw-hero { padding: 140px 24px 60px; }
    .hiw-steps { padding: 0 24px 80px; }
    .hiw-features { padding: 60px 24px 80px; }
    .hiw-cta { padding: 80px 24px 100px; }
    .hiw-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hiw-hero { padding: 120px 20px 48px; }
    .hiw-steps { padding: 0 20px 60px; }
    .hiw-features { padding: 48px 20px 60px; }
    .hiw-cta { padding: 60px 20px 80px; }
    .hiw-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hiw-step { grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .hiw-step-num { font-size: 48px; }
  }
</style>
